{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/JoinDiscord.png?t=1746965708\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They sent us in as a squad. Eight of us. Armed, trained, cleared for Level 5 anomalies. Breach at Site-\u2588\u2588, multiple SCPs confirmed. Our job: re-establish contact, recover critical data, extract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What they didn\u2019t mention? The site shifts. Doors vanish. Halls loop. And the moment we stepped inside, the entire team was scattered like dice across a board we didn\u2019t understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/Arsenal.jpg?t=1746965708\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now I don\u2019t know where the others are. Maybe they\u2019re still alive. Maybe they\u2019re talking to things that <i>sound</i> like them. I\u2019ve got my flashlight, two mags, and whatever I can scavenge off bodies\u2014ours or theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Containment is completely broken. I\u2019ve seen signs of \u2588\u2588, \u2588\u2588, and something that drags itself across ceilings whispering names. I\u2019m not sure how many SCPs are loose down here\u2014but one is too many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/SCPMask.png?t=1746965708\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019m moving room to room, scraping together access cards and fragments of corrupted data. The deeper I go, the stranger the world gets. Time\u2019s weird. Lights don\u2019t work right. Some corridors lead back to where I started.. but they\u2019re... wrong now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/HighresScreenshot000051.png?t=1746965708\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If I\u2019m lucky, I\u2019ll find another agent. Link up. Watch each other\u2019s backs. But out here? Trust is hard to come by. And I can\u2019t be sure what\u2019s human anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/SCP049.gif?t=1746965708\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you\u2019re hearing this, and you\u2019re going in next... remember:<br>The Foundation doesn\u2019t send teams to save people.<br><u>They send us to clean up.</u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2768300?t=1746965708","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2768300?t=1746965708","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/0f80b9b92cd5fa4083a932e986160c85db199f96/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746965708","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/0f80b9b92cd5fa4083a932e986160c85db199f96/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746965708","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/JoinDiscord.png?t=1746965708\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They sent us in as a squad. Eight of us. Armed, trained, cleared for Level 5 anomalies. Breach at Site-\u2588\u2588, multiple SCPs confirmed. Our job: re-establish contact, recover critical data, extract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What they didn\u2019t mention? The site shifts. Doors vanish. Halls loop. And the moment we stepped inside, the entire team was scattered like dice across a board we didn\u2019t understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/Arsenal.jpg?t=1746965708\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now I don\u2019t know where the others are. Maybe they\u2019re still alive. Maybe they\u2019re talking to things that <i>sound</i> like them. I\u2019ve got my flashlight, two mags, and whatever I can scavenge off bodies\u2014ours or theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Containment is completely broken. I\u2019ve seen signs of \u2588\u2588, \u2588\u2588, and something that drags itself across ceilings whispering names. I\u2019m not sure how many SCPs are loose down here\u2014but one is too many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/SCPMask.png?t=1746965708\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019m moving room to room, scraping together access cards and fragments of corrupted data. The deeper I go, the stranger the world gets. Time\u2019s weird. Lights don\u2019t work right. Some corridors lead back to where I started.. but they\u2019re... wrong now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/HighresScreenshot000051.png?t=1746965708\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If I\u2019m lucky, I\u2019ll find another agent. Link up. Watch each other\u2019s backs. But out here? Trust is hard to come by. And I can\u2019t be sure what\u2019s human anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/extras/SCP049.gif?t=1746965708\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you\u2019re hearing this, and you\u2019re going in next... remember:<br>The Foundation doesn\u2019t send teams to save people.<br><u>They send us to clean up.</u></p>","developers":["Adrastea Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768300/header.jpg?t=1746965708","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"SCP","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit Operating System<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4170 or AMD FX-8120<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX11 Compatible GeForce GTX 460 1GB or AMD HD 6850 1GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DX11 compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> With these requirements, it is recommended that the game is played on Low quality settings.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended: